        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YOWN32, Owen Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Round Owen Deadbolt will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. The Owen Deadbolt has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch backsets and 2-3/4 inch backsets and will fit standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches.  Choose from contemporary finish color options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Yale Expressions Owen Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Owen Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YOWN32-specifications.pdf?v=1704262435\"><b>Yale YOWN32 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
