                "description": "The Modern Round Owen Deadbolt will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. The Owen Deadbolt has an adjustable latch for 2-3/8 inch backsets and 2-3/4 inch backsets and will fit standard door thicknesses of 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches.  Choose from contemporary finish color options.",
